  {
    "name": "B1-4a treasury enter_date 轴行为（已入国库口径）",
    "type": "query",
    "layer": "轴随语义·行为",
    "query": {
      "measures": ["fiscal_treasury_view.amt", "fiscal_treasury_view.amt_yoy_diff"],
      "timeDimensions": [
        {
          "dimension": "fiscal_treasury_view.enter_date",
          "granularity": "month",
          "dateRange": ["2022-01-01", "2027-01-31"]
        }
      ],
      "filters": [
        { "member": "fiscal_treasury_view.enter_status", "operator": "equals", "values": ["1"] }
      ],
      "order": { "fiscal_treasury_view.enter_date": "asc" }
    },
    "renewQuery": true,
    "expect": {
      "rowKey": "month",
      "rows": {
        "2022-02": { "amt": "7520", "amt_yoy_diff": null },
        "2022-03": { "amt": "5444", "amt_yoy_diff": null },
        "2022-07": { "amt": "34", "amt_yoy_diff": null }
      },
      "shiftKeyRows": ["2023-02", "2023-03", "2023-07", "2027-01"],
      "note": "enter_status='1' 相邻年无同期对，数值闭环此路不通，轴生效靠 SQL(B1-4b)+键集行为：有值行仅 2022-02/03/07(2026-01=33306.09 时点值不作硬锚)；结果集含 amt=null 的平移键行(shiftKeyRows，引擎键集=本期∪平移期)；全行 diff=null。"
    }
  },
  {
    "name": "B1-4b treasury enter_date 轴 SQL 形态",
    "type": "sql",
    "layer": "轴随语义·SQL",
    "query": {
      "measures": ["fiscal_treasury_view.amt", "fiscal_treasury_view.amt_yoy_diff"],
      "timeDimensions": [
        {
          "dimension": "fiscal_treasury_view.enter_date",
          "granularity": "month",
          "dateRange": ["2022-01-01", "2027-01-31"]
        }
      ],
      "filters": [
        { "member": "fiscal_treasury_view.enter_status", "operator": "equals", "values": ["1"] }
      ]
    },
    "expect": {
      "caseInsensitive": true,
      "contains": ["fenterdate`) + INTERVAL 1 YEAR"],
      "notContains": ["isNotDistinctFrom", "addDate"],
      "note": "方言补丁两层形态：平移用 (col + INTERVAL 1 YEAR) 非 addDate；对齐用等值 join 非 isNotDistinctFrom。列名带 CUBE 前缀反引号（`fiscal_treasury`.`fenterdate`），contains 取尾部片段。另人工核对 enter_status='1' 同时出现在本期与平移子查询（filter 随平移走，同期口径一致）。"
    }
  },
